{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn10le17ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le17ob02re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn10le17ob02re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn10le17ob02re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Hello?\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hi Peter. Guess what? I just got the text that you sent yesterday. Isn't that bizarre?\nAnd I got it at precisely the same time that you sent it yesterday, but a day later.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Hmmm. That is weird. I think there's something wrong with my phone. I received a text this morning from a friend, asking me to come to his house at 9:00 a.m. I went to his house and he answered the door in his pyjamas. I showed him the text that I had received. He started laughing and said that he sent that text a month ago. I just received it today! He said he was wondering why I never showed up at his place.", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn10le17ob02re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh Peter. Have you backed up your phone? Maybe it's time for a new one.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: And a new computer.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: What do you mean? Do you need some help with your laptop?\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yes, that's why I'm calling. I wonder if you could do me a favor.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sure. What can I do?\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Can I ask you to send me an e-mail? Every time I try to reply to an e-mail the reply goes to a different person. There's some sort of glitch.", "time": "37000", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn10le17ob02re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Actually, now that you mention it, I have received some odd e-mails from you. I was wondering why you were sending me an e-mail asking if I knew any single women that I could introduce you to.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yeah, that's because they weren't for you. Oh, this is mortifying. That e-mails I wrote to one friend are going to another is very worrying.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Okay, well tell me how I can help. Let's do a test and we'll try to figure this out.", "time": "63000", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": []}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can discuss coincidences and strange events.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can express opinions and beliefs. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can ask and offer help with technical problems.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " What kinds of problems have you had with your computer?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Who do you ask for help when you have computer problems?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": " Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": " Technology Breakdown!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "STI", "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 1}], "_da